<title>USA: Star Funds to introduce three mutual funds Nov 30.</title>
<headline>Star Funds to introduce three mutual funds Nov 30.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI, Ohio 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Star Funds on Monday said it would introduce three funds effective November 30.</p>
<p>Star Funds will add an International Equity Fund, an Index Fund and an Ohio Tax-Free Money Market Fund, the company said in a statement, bringing the number of open end mutual funds offer by the company to 12.</p>
</text>
